413
00:43:04,310 --> 00:43:09,950
Now, I know that the Python typing community has something that's called the conformance test suite.

414
00:43:09,950 --> 00:43:18,870
So, what I'm wondering is how do you decide what new feature to add to PyreFly or what bug to fix?

415
00:43:18,870 --> 00:43:22,790
