00:48:31,390 --> 00:48:35,510
Like it can provide, for example, like give me the type at this position.

464
00:48:35,510 --> 00:48:45,630
The AI can query Pyreflite for that information and it's, you know, more reliable than like the AI having to do a bunch of like grepping and reading a bunch of files to try to piece together the context to get the type of something.

